# Mendicant Core, Guidelight: "Mendicant Core's power is equal to the number of artifacts you control." "Max speed - Whenever
# you cast an artifact spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, copy it. (The copy becomes a token.)" (CR 604.3, 702.178a, 707.10f)
# Bot1 casts the Core on turn 1 through three Moxen (speed 1, CR 702.179a): it is a 4/3, itself among its four artifacts.
# On turn 5 (speed 3) a Memnite makes no copy. Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face on turns 3, 5 and 7 gives speed 2, 3 and 4
# (CR 702.179d); on turn 7 the Memnite Bot1 casts is copied for {1} (Mox Pearl): the copy resolves as a Memnite token, so
# seven artifacts stand and the Core is a 7/3.

